  "scope": "Static sagittal gravity energy after exact ground support translation, at fixed symmetric closed-linkage hip poses. Track the nearest local minimum from the initial -70 degree back rest as hips unfold; expose jumps and all local minima rather than assuming continuity. Barrier is to the first sampled local maximum in the direction of decreasing pitch, or null if absent. Actual native hulls/cylinders and rigid mass properties; no time integration, friction, angular momentum, actuator or damping analysis. A sampled local energy minimum is not proof of contact-force equilibrium, lateral stability, continuous clearance or mechanical strength. This does not alter any dynamic recording or qualify a redesigned body."
